Ghost Wolf ItemTransfer
    Events
        Unit - A unit owned by Player 1 (Red) Acquires an item
    Conditions
        And - All (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Nazgrek (Ghost Wolf - Level 1)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Zul'kis (melee Ghost Wolf - Level 1)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Zul'kis (ranged Ghost Wolf - Level 1)
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
            Then - Actions
                Hero - Give (Item being manipulated) to NazgrekMorph
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
            Then - Actions
                Hero - Give (Item being manipulated) to ZulkisMorph
            Else - Actions
